  <participating-org role="4" type="24">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LBH APIK was formed by Indonesian Women&apos;s Association for Justice in 1995, with a background of shared concern to provide legal services and support for women with feminist perspective. Since February 21st 2003, LBH APIK has officially become the LBH APIK JakartaFoundation, based on the Notarial Deed No. Rusnaldy. 112/2003. LBH APIK Jakarta provides legal aid for women, especially poor womenusing Structural Gender Legal Aid. This legal aid uses perspective and gender analysis that leads to changes in the structure of society and the legal system (the substance, structure and culture). In 2013, LBH APIK Jakarta was officially accredited by the Ministry of Law and Human Rights as a legal aid provider for women in Jakarta.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Yayasan LBH APIK Jakarta</narrative>
